# Home Decor PLP Extraction — environment template
#
# Audited 2026-09-11: none of the scripts in pipeline/*_json_archive/ currently
# read any environment variables — they operate entirely on the local
# filesystem. No API keys, tokens, or credentials are required to run the
# merge/verify scripts. This file exists as the conventional place to put any
# secrets you introduce later; copy it to `.env` and fill in real values
# there. Never commit `.env` itself (it's excluded in .gitignore).
#
# Known portability limitation (documented in README "Limitations"): every
# pipeline/*_json_archive/*.py script hardcodes its project root as an
# absolute Windows path, e.g.:
#   PROJ = r"C:\Users\GyanendraVishwakarma\Web Research Agent"
# If you clone this repo elsewhere, update that constant at the top of each
# script you run rather than expecting an env var to redirect it — that
# indirection does not exist yet.

# --- Reserved for future use (uncomment and fill in if you wire these up) ---
# HTTP_PROXY=
# HTTPS_PROXY=
# CLAUDE_API_KEY=
